{"id":"1804949616","kind":"answer","title":"如何结合遗忘曲线记单词？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2021-03-28","updated":"2021-03-28","votes":31,"comment_count":0,"minutes":2,"chars":756,"keywords":["记忆稳定性","可提取性","间隔重复","卡片难度","SuperMemo"],"summary":"别再提什么艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线、记忆曲线了。。。 先搞懂记忆原理：(太长不看就继续往下) 叶峻峣：记忆的两个组成成分|浓缩通俗版 遗忘曲线的本质是记忆的可提取性（Retrievability ）随时间指数下降。 而每次重复可以提高记忆的稳定性（Stability）。 公式： S 提高，那 R 下降的速度就变慢了，所以才有间隔重复能…","question_detail_html":"","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/449847342/answer/1804949616","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"fUxFM97x\">别再提什么艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线、记忆曲线了。。。</p><p data-pid=\"sStLlMlL\">先搞懂记忆原理：(太长不看就继续往下)</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-da4049a237bff530d50e60843b3a2e0b_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"541\" data-image-width=\"1794\" data-tm-id=\"179076885\" href=\"#/post/179076885\">叶峻峣：记忆的两个组成成分|浓缩通俗版</a><p data-pid=\"6cMzXIYN\">遗忘曲线的本质是记忆的可提取性（Retrievability ）随时间指数下降。</p><p data-pid=\"3iXCUgv3\">而每次重复可以提高记忆的稳定性（Stability）。</p><p data-pid=\"7KoESQh8\">公式：</p><p data-pid=\"WgE47uME\"><img alt=\"R=e^{-t/S}\" class=\"math-eq\" eeimg=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=R%3De%5E%7B-t%2FS%7D\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"GiirSmjt\">S 提高，那 R 下降的速度就变慢了，所以才有间隔重复能够使记忆记得更牢。</p><p data-pid=\"unlTKfMP\">而完整的公式是</p><p data-pid=\"-r9yobvV\"><img alt=\"R_i(t)=\\exp^{(t*\\ln(K)/(C_1*C_2^{i-1}))}\" class=\"math-eq\" eeimg=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=R_i%28t%29%3D%5Cexp%5E%7B%28t%2A%5Cln%28K%29%2F%28C_1%2AC_2%5E%7Bi-1%7D%29%29%7D\"/> </p><p data-pid=\"cVjWvRSV\">K 是预期的保留率（比如我这次记 100 个单词，预期记住 100 * K 个）</p><p data-pid=\"C_U9DVSo\">i 是第 i 次重复</p><p data-pid=\"MaRG2TpZ\">C1 是第一次重复的间隔</p><p data-pid=\"0wuNcCru\">C2 是记忆内容的难度（越难越小）</p><p data-pid=\"z62yQMiw\">（好吧理论看不懂也没关系）</p><hr/><p data-pid=\"_fkA8hpP\">所以就会有这张图：</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-be9d0b0c5dcb41247df567d086a58d80\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-be9d0b0c5dcb41247df567d086a58d80_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-be9d0b0c5dcb41247df567d086a58d80\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-be9d0b0c5dcb41247df567d086a58d80_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"OO6ajTVi\">那该怎么做？</p><p data-pid=\"ZYiFkYYq\">应该<b>动态</b>的调整复习的间隔。</p><p data-pid=\"q2w4cuhZ\">比如我第一天背了单词 A，第 1 次复习就隔 1 天，第 2 次复习就隔 C 天，第 n 次复习就隔 <img alt=\"C^{n-1}\" class=\"math-eq\" eeimg=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://www.zhihu.com/equation?tex=C%5E%7Bn-1%7D\"/> 天。如果中间有一次复习忘记了，那么就重新开始，并且 C 要下调，因为记不住可能是因为这个单词对于我的难度较高，需要调整。</p><p data-pid=\"Uy2c59pt\">如果只有几个单词，这样人工去计算间隔还算简单，但是需要背很多单词的话，就需要借助工具来安排复习了。</p><p data-pid=\"_OdhDwNX\">这里我推荐使用 Anki——开源、免费的多平台记忆软件：</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-20d50031f4fd3464e19584f9c68ab210\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-20d50031f4fd3464e19584f9c68ab210_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"634\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-20d50031f4fd3464e19584f9c68ab210\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-20d50031f4fd3464e19584f9c68ab210_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"634\"/></figure><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><p data-pid=\"Vd7H9-x7\">左边是正面，可以用一个例句来辅助自己理解单词的语境，右边是背面，有中文翻译，将单词对应的中文标记就能来测试自己了。</p><p data-pid=\"TfK2AAxs\">然后这些例句和翻译，用有道词典什么的查单词，都会有双语例句，复制粘贴，就能做出卡片。</p><p data-pid=\"hs9XRCbV\">Anki 自带算法，按照我们自己的记忆情况，来安排下一次复习的时间：</p><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-ffa93924ac6237d52d8120dc6ebd5560\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ffa93924ac6237d52d8120dc6ebd5560_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-ffa93924ac6237d52d8120dc6ebd5560\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ffa93924ac6237d52d8120dc6ebd5560_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></figure><hr/><p data-pid=\"d1N46eBG\">Anki 支持 windows、mac、linux、安卓、苹果等常见设备，并且可以多端同步，走到哪学到哪。</p><p data-pid=\"KAITug8L\">为了帮到有缘人，我写了一份快速上手教程：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-image=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/v2-acfa8f607f2d3c74ba5c660c3ab25df0_180x120.jpg\" data-image-height=\"500\" data-image-width=\"1161\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/61564332\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">叶峻峣：Anki 教程(电子书)与 B 站 Ankidroid 教程(视频)快速通道</a><p></p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"179076885","title":"记忆的两个组成成分|浓缩通俗版","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":75,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 2 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"279166945","title":"间隔效应","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":21,"minutes":3,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"274352214","title":"遗忘曲线","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":22,"minutes":5,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"99505568","title":"05 1988：记忆的两个组成成分","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":49,"minutes":20,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"},{"id":"1907760881749718522","title":"间隔重复记忆系统：已取得长足进步","author":"Domenic Denicola","votes":261,"minutes":12,"reason":"延伸深读 · Domenic Denicola"},{"id":"563438547","title":"记忆召回","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Piotr Wozniak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"961619758","title":"背单词的过程中，如何形成牢固的记忆？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":30,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 30 赞同"},{"id":"999630947","title":"背单词时怎样做到背了新单词而不忘背过的旧词？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":12,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 12 赞同"},{"id":"1319708582","title":"按遗忘曲线复习效率更高吗？为什么我觉得没什么效果呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":63,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 63 赞同"},{"id":"959753274","title":"手机上的anki app 复习的间隔时间可以改吗 在哪里改？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":40,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 40 赞同"},{"id":"1806471739","title":"有哪些科学的记忆方法可以提升学习成绩呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":19,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 19 赞同"}]}